-- ─── misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- background_color / force_default_wallpaper dropped: they painted the desktop
-- black (no wallpaper daemon ran, and nixpkgs' hyprland ships no wallpaper
-- assets for force_default_wallpaper to fall back to). No wallpaper is set here;
-- DMS's Wallpaper settings (SUPER + comma) drives hyprpaper/swww/feh/gsettings
-- if you want one.
